{"pin":"AB04273","subcodes":[{"code":"AB04273","anchor":"","first_line":"O servant of the divine Threshold! The letter which thou didst address to Siyyid Asadu'llah was perused. After returning [3.5s]... ...The teacher, when teaching, must be himself fully enkindled, so that his utterance, like unto a flame of fire, may exert influence","first_line_orig":"ای بنده آستان الهی نامه ای که بسید اسدالله مرقوم نمودی ملاحظه گردید بعد از مراجعت  ","language":"Per","word_count":"170","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"music","code":"N. Affolter","source":"N","locator":"Affolter","url":"https://youtu.be/x-9NFO7RM6o"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#217 p.260x","source":"MMK1","locator":"217 p.260x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/136833010"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NJB_v04#15 p.003x","source":"NJB_v04","locator":"15 p.003x","url":"https://bahai.works/Star_of_the_West/Volume_4/Issue_15"},{"kind":"publication","code":"YARP2.111 p.136","source":"YARP2","locator":"111 p.136","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/YP/yp-142.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"YHA2.1000-1001x","source":"YHA2","locator":"1000-1001x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/684.pdf#page=-443"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SWAB#217x","source":"SWAB","locator":"217x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/784974807"}]}]}
